{"title":"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a finite sequence of real numbers the sum of any seven successive terms is negative and the sum of any eleven successive terms is positive. Determine the maximum number of terms in the sequence.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/9/679d0a6d6cef45b71d1a66078ca115bdca133558.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1,x_2,\\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"11\" /> be the given sequence and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/e/7be68d0ba5368617e667b77e8f01f7bc0cb02423.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_n=x_1+x_2+\\ldots+x_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"184\" height=\"13\" />.\nThe conditions from the hypothesis can be now written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/7/e97141de332ed6423327b4c3727325847e8442e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_{n+7}&lt;s_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b387c904aa2e8fd46bc933b41022e54ab23e7bf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_{n+11}&gt;s_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/6/0965ac6a39c0b4d67771c31210b98312ae2e4f01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />.\nWe then have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/a/d3a8594dc9b2ce33f99aaa26391a5849d367775a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;s_{11}&lt;s_4&lt;s_{15}&lt;s_8&lt;s_1&lt;s_{12}&lt;s_5&lt;s_{16}&lt;s_9&lt;s_2&lt;s_{13}&lt;s_6&lt;s_{17}&lt;s_{10}&lt;s_3&lt;s_{14}&lt;s_7&lt;0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"786\" height=\"17\" />\na contradiction. Therefore, the sequence cannot have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms.\nIn order to show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is the answer, just take 16 real numbers satisfying\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/e/60e73f53454f0c2f4b8bdff5887e27f1b760a101.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_{10}&lt;s_3&lt;s_{14}&lt;s_7&lt;0&lt;s_{11}&lt;s_4&lt;s_{15}&lt;s_8&lt;s_1&lt;s_{12}&lt;s_5&lt;s_{16}&lt;s_9&lt;s_2&lt;s_{13}&lt;s_6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"697\" height=\"15\" />.\nWe have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba706c859520215c7b9be61d309f11a8e94cdc93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1=s_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/9/14956105015f85841afb73ba2bb57d742bc93052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_n=s_n-s_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"10\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/a/39abfe232e2ed5247aa4028089e5f651090e66da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. Thus we found all sequences with the given properties.\n</p><p>The above solution was posted and copyrighted by enescu. The original thread for this problem can be found here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://aops.com/community/p369641\">[1]</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO\" title=\"1977 IMO\">1977 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017172545\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 68/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 895/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2431/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.604      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    6.604      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20520:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017172545 and revision id 143940. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}